        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell" table:number-columns-spanned="2" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">입법일정(예정)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">관계기관<text:line-break/>협의기간</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p text:style-name="Center">20  .  .  .부터　20  .  .  .까지(　일간)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">입법예고기간</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p text:style-name="Center">20  .  .  .부터　20  .  .  .까지(　일간)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>

        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell" table:number-columns-spanned="2" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">첨부자료</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">법령자료</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellSmall" table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p text:style-name="Left">법령안 전문 및 제·개정내용, 신·구조문 대비표, 법령안 설명자료</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">정책자료</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellSmall" table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p text:style-name="Left">정책 관련 참고자료, 관련 통계(승인통계, 행정자료, 내부 보유자료 등)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>

        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">실질평가에 대한<text:line-break/>소관기관 의견</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellSmall" table:number-columns-spanned="8"><text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 정책에 필요한 통계지표 구비, 통계개발·개선계획 필요성 여부를 기재</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>

        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell" table:number-columns-spanned="1" table:number-rows-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="Center">정<text:line-break/>책<text:line-break/>1</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">도입/변경되<text:line-break"/>는 정책의<text:line-break"/>주요내용</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellSmall" table:number-columns-spanned="8">
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 정책명</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 정책 목적 및 필요성</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 정책의 주요내용</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">- 도입근거</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">- 추진방향</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">- 세부내용(현행/변경)</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 기대효과</text:p>
          </table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">집행/평가<text:line-break/>단계별<text:line-break"/>통계지표</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellSmall" table:number-columns-spanned="8">
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 통계지표</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">- 지표구분(집행/평가 지표)</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">- 유용성</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">- 정보출처</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">- 작성방식</text:p>
          </table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">통계개발·<text:line-break"/>개선계획</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellSmall" table:number-columns-spanned="8">
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 통계지표명</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 통계작성 및 자료수집방법: □ 조사　□ 보고　□ 가공</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 통계작성 목적</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 법적근거</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 통계작성 대상</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 통계작성 사항</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 통계작성 주기</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 통계작성 체계</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Left">▪ 추진일정(계획수립, 조사시기, 공표시기 등)</text:p>
          </table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">2</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="8"><text:p text:style-name="Left">:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>

